 and psychological hang ups and used the resulting inspiration to write a description of an NWOD game that would be scary for <b>me</b>. I do realize that a game where it is said 9 out of 10 times in the manual that you can't make the tiniest difference would become comically edgy without a careful touch indeed. However, in the off chance that I managed to run or participate in a Deviant chronicle that does it <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>just</i></span> right, it would be cathartic beyond description.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>that synospis was scarier than most horror movies i watched","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 07-30-2015, 07:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T16:31:54-07:00","id":608600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Heavy\">Dviant: The ??? <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">\u2013 You woke up\u2026different. Someone changed you; on a slab, an operating table,<br /> <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">an altar. By luck or by fate, you escaped. Hunted by the ones who made you, they hold all the cards.<br /> <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">Except one thing, what they don\u2019t know is that a fire burns within you because what they did wasn\u2019t<br /> <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">right. What they don\u2019t know is that YOU\u2019RE hunting THEM. <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Heavy\">Deviant: The ??? <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">presents a game where<br /> <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">the victims of experiments band together to bring down the monolithic organizations that twisted and<br /> <span style=\"font-family:FuturaPT-Book\">warped them.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>So combine Demon with Hunter.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T17:23:20-07:00","id":608639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=608557#post608557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know it's a bit off-topic - But should not the Dragons by the Ugallu, not Eshmaki?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can make a strong case for any and all the Families for different dragon types. It all depends on how you envision the dragon in question. Certainly, all the Hungers apply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T17:23:59-07:00","id":608641,"title":"","content":"My first thought was that the blurb sounded like Changeling + Demon. I'll echo the previous hopes that it expands more on the antagonistic human occulty-corporations we've seen so little of in other lines. I also really hope it's explicitly written with crossover in mind - as mentioned, the deviants described could come from basically any other splat's tampering or someone trying to replicate them - and I find that to be a very strong good point for Deviant. If it runs with it, we'd get some meaningful expansion for everything, and likely without diluting Deviant's theme's at all.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T17:24:46-07:00","id":608642,"title":"","content":"I have to confess, part of what excites me about this is how non-Demon-y it might be able to be. Perhaps the party responsible for your suffering could even be... Some random person in a town, with very little connection to grand supernatural powers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""