mhuck and turn him into a deviant! Then the deviant would fuck the spirits and hosts up and do all the hard work for us!&quot; Other Werewolf :&quot;hell yeah!&quot;. And 2 years later the deviant got the spirits on his side and now they're evirasciting Werewolfs like munchkins","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 08-01-2015, 02:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-31T23:51:09-07:00","id":610507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610445#post610445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Everyone's latched onto the scientific/medical side of things and completely missed the &quot;altar&quot; bit, which has me more excited than anything else. Being the unwilling creation of a dark cult (Arisen or otherwise) of some sort? Sign me up for twelve copies.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ya sorry about that... I was just correcting someone x.x I am totally psyched for Deviant though, and want to know more about what this game is about, whether its Occult side or Science side. (I'm maybe not as psyched as I was about Beast, but still want to know more)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/BeastThePrimordial.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":6566,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","user":"Draca","date":". 08-01-2015, 02:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","name":"Draca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6566_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-31T23:59:15-07:00","id":610509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610500#post610500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can see the werewolf as the bad guys of a devuant chronicle like Alpha Werewolf &quot;you know what guys? We could totally stop defending people from spirits and shit,all we gotta do is find some smhuck and turn him into a deviant! Then the deviant would fuck the spirits and hosts up and do all the hard work for us!&quot; Other Werewolf :&quot;hell yeah!&quot;. And 2 years later the deviant got the spirits on his side and know he's evirasciting Werewolf like this munchkins</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't think it was possible to have a worse misunderstanding of the Uratha than &quot;spirit cops,&quot; but there it is.<br /> __<br /> <br /> <i>Honor your territory in all things.</i><br /> <br /> The sole additional duty that <i>Sagrim-Ur</i> has charged his Forsaken children with is a chiding reminder that the changes they seek to effect in their hunting must serve a purpose, but Red Wolf has always shivered and delighted to see strange new things brought into town; it's part of why he loves to watch his Iron Masters deal with the human herd.<br /> <br /> So when the Soulsmiths of West Hampton saw the ailing neighborhood and decided to try the bizarre ritual they extracted from last year's vagrant <i>magath</i> on the sole surviving casualty of last month's hunt for want of a better solution, they took the Audience's unmistakable attention as a go-ahead.<br /> <br /> As he watches the pulsing wave of flesh crash through his safehouse door, the exhausted Threefingered Bobby reflects that this may have been an error in judgement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T00:34:47-07:00","id":610520,"title":"","content":"When you think about it,creating a deviant is a really big act of h\u00fabris,because if a person knows enough about them to want to create one for a purpose,that person probably hears that some deviant got free and sough terrible revenge on it's creators. A potential creator would probably know that. He would to be awfully sure of himself to still go on and create an deviant","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T01:01:52-07:00","id":610544,"title":"","content":"I'll spend a moment stating that I too thought of it as similar to changeling,and demon's themes<br /> I know thematically it makes sense for demons to want to kill their maker, as the God Machine is trying to kill them, but I'm not too interested in another game like that.<br /> <br /> I would personally like a game where a group is experimenting on people to give them supernatural elements because people are tired of ignoring what goes bump in the night; but then again, thats practically another hunter game, except centering on the Lucifage conspricy.<br /> <br /> So that said, I wonder what the difference is between the hunter's with supernatural endowments, and deviants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1377-wrequis","name":"Wrequis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T01:15:30-07:00","id":610547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=608557#post608557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know it's a bit off-topic - But should not the Dragons by the Ugallu, not Eshmaki?</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking at the Beast Atavisms, things that are mandatory for either or both of th most common varieties of dragon are spread evenly throughout the families.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T01:15:43-07:00","id":610548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wrequis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610544#post610544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So that said, I wonder what the difference is between the hunter's with supernatural endowments, and deviants.</div> </div> </div> </div>Since they are Major Template, the main difference is Deviants are no longer humans.<br /> Besides, there is the whole &quot;I never asked for this...&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T01:35:47-07:00","id":610553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610421#post610421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Were they people turned into androids? Or more created from scratch?</div> </div> </div> </div>17 and 18 were humans modified on a cellular level with a bio-mechanical compound and then given cybernetic implants.<br /> <br /> the use of the term &quot;Android&quot; in dragonball was a case of bad translation-the japanese term translated to &quot;Artificial Humans&quot;, but at the time of the first translation, the only Artificial Human we had seen was an android and the later examples included androids, cyborgs, and at least one purely organic being that was created via DNA splicing and cloning.<br /> <br /> In Total, we saw 3 androids, 3 cyborgs*, and 1 Clone, though counting sources of non-or-dubious continuity we can add 3 more androids and 1 more cyborg.<br /> <br /> But that's only counting the Red Ribbon &quot;Androids&quot; Other androids and cyborgs are present in the franchise, though they follow different rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":3405,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","user":"Rater202","date":". 08-01-2015, 04:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T06:10:40-07:00","id":610714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=609371#post609371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well, when I read the blurb about Deviant, I immediately thought of the Invisible Man, both the movie and the television series.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had the thought of someone prepared for possession by an entity, but escaped with the process half-done.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> All the fun body horror stuff that TCG is renowned for. I mean, obviously, there are going to be differences, since this won't be a game about hunters; it'll be a different focus, absolutely. But there's still a lot of similarity here. And who ever said that the TCG agents had full agency? </div> </div> </div>Even if it's not Cheiron itself, it's only a matter of time until someone who knows less about what they're doing tries to replicate thaumotech. (In general, failed attempts to create members of the other game lines are a rich source of potential Deviants).<br /> <br /> From that quote of DaveB:<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you were disappointed by Beast being hugh powered and not visibly monstrous to bystanders, Deviant is the exact opposite. </div> </div> </div>This implies Deviants are low powered, but it also implies they're visibly monstrous, or at least can be.<br /> <br /> Everyone's latched onto the scientific/medical side of things and completely missed the &quot;altar&quot; bit, which has me more excited than anything else. Being the unwilling creation of a dark cult (Arisen or otherwise) of some sort? Sign me up for twelve copies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610445#post610445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Everyone's latched onto the scientific/medical side of things and completely missed the &quot;altar&quot; bit, which has me more excited than anything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been bringing it up whenever I can.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T07:22:44-07:00","id":610787,"title":"","content":"The difference between magic and science is in the source of the effect not the effect itself. Deviant reminds me of Tagers and Dhohanoids from Cthulhutech which is itself derivative of Guyver and a reinterpretation of science effects using magic. At this point everything in the modern world is derivative of something else. The most you can hope for is unique, a thing that stands out on its own. This the eleventh game line? The previous ten were unique. No reason to think this one will not be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T08:16:37-07:00","id":610845,"title":"","content":"My first thought on reading the blurb was, &quot;Hey, looks like Rose got her 'mutants' game after all.&quot; Sure, it's perhaps a bit more Inhumans and less X-Men, but being converted from a human being against your will is not uncommon in a comic book backstory. This way, though, gets the horror theme across perfectly. Can't wait to hear more!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4732-drazosh","name":"Drazosh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T08:47:42-07:00","id":610905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=610307#post610307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your Astral bog monster Beast reached her Inheritance, and is now an embodied real bog monster in the real world. Bam. Done.<br /> <br /> Ask your ST if you can play a Beast after their Inheritance. It may be difficult since you're literally just a monster, but you said you wanna do that, so.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, it's the wrong themes. Think more Alligator People. So not bam and not done. This why Deviant looks so interesting.<br /> <br /> Also, I am the storyteller...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T11:02:07-07:00","id":611082,"title":"","content":"The blurb:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Deviant: The ??? \u2013 You woke up\u2026different. Someone changed you; on a slab, an operating table, an altar. By luck or by fate, you escaped. Hunted by the ones who made you, they hold all the cards. Except one thing, what they don\u2019t know is that a fire burns within you because what they did wasn\u2019t right. What they don\u2019t know is that YOU\u2019RE hunting THEM. Deviant: The ??? presents a game where the victims of experiments band together to bring down the monolithic organizations that twisted and warped them.</i> </div> </div> </div>Made me think about this great anime series I watched year ago - <b>Guyver</b>!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/9z7OW1JTJ4M\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/9z7OW1JTJ4M\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/9z7OW1JTJ4M\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/9z7OW1JTJ4M </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T13:28:46-07:00","id":611275,"title":"","content":"Personally, I'm getting flashes of the anime, Cyborg 009, myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T16:42:47-07:00","id":611449,"title":"","content":"I don't expect Deviant to be primarily about victims of mad scientists; but I'll probably be disappointed if it doesn't at least support that as an option. <br /> <br /> Conversely, I find myself wondering about how Deviants compare to agents of the Cheiron Group: both are people who have been changed by the efforts of a corporation, with the main difference probably being that Deviants are at odds with the ones who changed them while Cheiron agents are generally aligned with them. Of course, that all depends on the nature of the changes that a Deviant is subjected to\u2026<br /> <br /> Bottom line, I'm cautiously optimistic and look forward to more reveals about Deviant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T16:57:30-07:00","id":611464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jacob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=609807#post609807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's fine, but I wish they'd change the name to something more descriptive of the splat, like Revenant, Wight, Zombie, anything but Ghost (or the German equivalent) because you don't actually play ghosts, you play claimed made from ghosts and dead people (which sounds more like a revenant to me...).</div> </div> </div> </div>A defining feature of <b>Geist</b> is that Sin-Eaters <i>used to be dead</i>, but aren't anymore; they've been given a second chance at <i>life</i>, not a state of undeath, and are very specifically <i>not</i> revenants, wights, zombies, or anything of the sort. <br /> <br /> I'm not sure what this has to do with Deviant, though\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T18:48:23-07:00","id":611605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yaoi Huntress Earth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=611275#post611275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I'm getting flashes of the anime, Cyborg 009, myself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like another said earlier, I'm leaning towards Kamen Rider myself. Speaking of which, I wonder if Deviants have to be unwilling to be transformed into what they are, or can they pull a Stronger and deliberately let themselves be warped into a monster in order to hurt their enemy more?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T23:36:06-07:00","id":611937,"title":"","content":"What I'm curious about is how Deviants are going to find each other. It seems like a Deviant hell-bent on taking down an evil pharmaceutical company isn't too likely to cross paths with a Deviant who's hunting the members of a secretive cult that worships ancient mind-melting horrors, much less actually team up with them. I suppose the default assumption could be to have players all create characters that were victims of the same conspiracy, but I seriously doubt that will be the case. It sounds like Deviants won't all be the same type of supernatural creature (even if mechanically, they'll all have the same template) in the same way that Vampires, Werewolves, Changelings, etc are, so I doubt they'll have an innate power for spotting other Deviants. I mean, it wouldn't make much sense for the bio-engineered super soldier to be able to sense the poor cult victim tainted by a presence from an unseen dimension. That is, unless there's some common element that's necessary in the creation of a Deviant, despite the means used to alter them (similar to Azoth for Prometheans), but again, that seems unlikely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5910-csschulz","name":"CSSchulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5910_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T00:16:34-07:00","id":611949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=611605#post611605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like another said earlier, I'm leaning towards Kamen Rider myself. Speaking of which, I wonder if Deviants have to be unwilling to be transformed into what they are, or can they pull a Stronger and deliberately let themselves be warped into a monster in order to hurt their enemy more?</div> </div> </div> </div> I Can't find the quote,but i saw dave brookshaw saying on 4chan that a person can turn themselves into a deviant in a Doctor jekyll and mister hide situation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T00:28:59-07:00","id":611951,"title":"","content":"Something i'm wodnering right now is if deviant it's going to have 5 differents splats of characters with substantial differences within the species like,vampire,changeling,promethean,Geist and Beast. or if it will be like the games where the characters are more or less alike without any big differences within the species like werewolf,mage and demon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 08-02-2015, 03:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T08:15:22-07:00","id":612235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=611949#post611949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I Can't find the quote,but i saw dave brookshaw saying on 4chan that a person can turn themselves into a deviant in a Doctor jekyll and mister hide situation</div> </div> </div> </div>I can verify the quote since I'm the one who asked him over there. He said there will be an option for Deviants to be a product of experimenting on themselves rather than others experimenting on them. He listed Dr. Jekyll &amp; Mr. Hyde as well as the Fly amongst the gameline's sources for inspiration, as well as Akira.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T08:50:49-07:00","id":612292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=611951#post611951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> without any big differences within the species like werewolf,mage and demon?</div> </div> </div> </div> Speak for yourself. Werewolf and mage have huge differences between the different auspices and paths. DtD doesn't, but that's deliberate, since IC-wise, the division between Incarnations is actually a mistake on the parts of the Unchained- the God Machine doesn't use it.<br /> <br /> Anyways, the point is that, even if there's not a huge difference between affinity powers (still disagree about Mage and Wolf, but Geist could count), there's a number of lesser things that apply. In Geist, for instance, Threshold is important for resonating with keys and methods of death over the course of play, not just at character creation. In Mage, Path determines tools, oblations, spells you cast without a mana tax, nimbus, and what Supernal critters you can call. That's a lot of things that aren't immediately obvious. So, even if you feel there's not a lot of &quot;differences,&quot; there actually will be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 08-02-2015, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T10:15:58-07:00","id":612358,"title":"","content":"The major antagonist will not be from any existing splat or product, I can tell you that flat out. The history of New World of Darkness has always been to create something new whole cloth for each game, even if something similar or near identical exists elsewhere. So if any part of the antagonist group involves an evil pharmaceutical company for example, it will be an entirely new one and not one from Hunter, Mummy, Promethean, or anything else. Likewise, there will be some kind of roadblock to prevent any of the main groups from other game lines for being the antagonist faction: no Ordo Dracul, no Cheiron Group, no mummies, no prometheans.<br /> <br /> The options I can see most likely are<br /> <br /> 1. One large overarching antagonist, detailed in the book. Possible but not entirely likely from the sounds of it.<br /> 2. A series of detailed competing organizations. Interesting, but probably not in the new World of Darkness style.<br /> 3. A section on how the ST should make antagonists. I call it the lazy method.<br /> 4. A section on how the players will make their own individual antagonists to suit character, either within constraints or not.<br /> <br /> I could also think of a few ideas that would be really cool that I know aren't going to be implemented, so I'm just going to forget I had them lest I go insane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T10:22:18-07:00","id":612387,"title":"","content":"Actually, if I can persuade a) Rich and b) the Hunter Developer, Deviant <i>will</i> have Cheiron as one of the example antagonists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":23}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T10:27:31-07:00","id":612392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612387#post612387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, if I can persuade a) Rich and b) the Hunter Developer, Deviant <i>will</i> have Cheiron as one of the example antagonists.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you think you can answer what i i asked yesteday on this thread? if this game will be with 5 diferentes splats or something diferent? It's probably too soon but if you could answer it would be nice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T10:29:31-07:00","id":612393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612358#post612358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The major antagonist will not be from any existing splat or product, I can tell you that flat out.</div> </div> </div> </div>LMAO.<br /> <br /> Sorry. After reading Dave's response, I did literally laugh. Hard.<br /> <br /> Can we maybe wait for a bit more info before giving these &quot;I guarantee...&quot; or &quot;flat out&quot; responses?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T11:30:24-07:00","id":612438,"title":"","content":"I can easily see separate splats based on how you became a deviant.<br /> Like, group 1 - Cheiron Victims - you WERE a hunter, until you went under the knife for an upgrade and it took a little TOO well. And now you're the enemy.<br /> Group 2 - Cult Victims - You were kidnapped by a cult, who was going to sacrifice you to some outer god thing, but when they cut your heart out, something from outside came back and filled the hole.<br /> Group 3 - Drug trials by the antagonist group from Mummy.<br /> Etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T12:27:42-07:00","id":612506,"title":"","content":"I'd kind of like to know if external deformity/monstrousness is mandatory, or if it's optional.<br /> <br /> And also if it's an all the time thing or a &quot;when using powers thing&quot; or a &quot;depends o the situation&quot; thing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T12:34:46-07:00","id":612509,"title":"","content":"Given the vague information on Deviant so far, it seems a bit premature to assume any solid details about them. It would be silly to not include an organization from another game if it fits well in this game. I think it is a safe assumption that no organization from another game purposefully creates Deviants. Cheiron probably inadvertently creates them as a unintended consequence of their R&amp;D projects. Mages might create Deviants, Rogue researchers from the Ordo Dracul as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T13:12:10-07:00","id":612530,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see the Ordo Dracul and an Arisen cult as example groups. God-Machine projects have the potential to be pretty horrific as well, with the body rejecting alien cybernetic implants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T13:26:43-07:00","id":612533,"title":"","content":"What catches my interest most about Deviant is why they chose that name specifically.<br /> <br /> After looking up a literal definition of the word deviant and reading some of the confirmed blurbs I have a few theories that I think would tie into the aesthetic and maybe even the focus of the game.<br /> <br /> 1) I think Deviant might truly be a game about acceptions to the rules. If they are humans who were captured and transformed by shadowed conspiracies (be they corporate, mystical, or scientific) then a Deviant can literally be made by any method. You want a Defiant Coterie to capture a poor bastard and reasearch new Coils on him than more power too you, that's just how they becomes a Devaint. What makes them a Deviant is the focus of point 2.<br /> <br /> 2) I think all Deviants are accidents on the part of their creators. For example the Dragon's experiments worked perfectly but their test subject proved to be more fortuitous than their tests projected and instead of becoming a corpse they became something...else. Something unpredicted that now runs loose through the city and threatens the Masquerade and the Order. That's what I think will make someone a Deviant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":". 08-02-2015, 04:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T14:59:00-07:00","id":612630,"title":"","content":"Let's cover the most important part of this game. When can we volunteer to play test? Because we only have a handful of quotes to speculate on and I really want to get involved with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T15:05:25-07:00","id":612631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612387#post612387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, if I can persuade a) Rich and b) the Hunter Developer, Deviant <i>will</i> have Cheiron as one of the example antagonists.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought Chuck left to work on his own projects? or are you attempting to see if you can bring him back in at a later date.<br /> <br /> speaking of which, he's posting on twitter about being taken over by a spider on twitter at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T16:40:38-07:00","id":612781,"title":"","content":"Chuck was at GenCon, actually! He's writing one of the Star Wars novels set between the original trilogy and Force Awakens.<br /> <br /> No, I was speaking of the Dev for Hunter 2E, which was announced at the con. Who I obviously know the identity of.*<br /> <br /> <br /> * - No, it's not Chuck. Much as we all miss Chuck, and jealously curse his success as a proper author whenever we see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T17:16:19-07:00","id":612796,"title":"","content":"Mildly curious, was there a reason Hunter's Developer wasn't announced?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T17:49:34-07:00","id":612853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612781#post612781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chuck was at GenCon, actually! He's writing one of the Star Wars novels set between the original trilogy and Force Awakens.<br /> <br /> No, I was speaking of the Dev for Hunter 2E, which was announced at the con. Who I obviously know the identity of.*<br /> <br /> <br /> * - No, it's not Chuck. Much as we all miss Chuck, and jealously curse his success as a proper author whenever we see it.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it was announced then why wouldn't you just say the person's name?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T17:54:44-07:00","id":612858,"title":"","content":"It's being developed by The Computer, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T17:55:58-07:00","id":612860,"title":"","content":"Clearly he can't say his True Name, so perhaps the Hunter dev still hasn't picked a cover identity to use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2050-dawngreeter","name":"Dawngreeter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2050_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T17:57:39-07:00","id":612863,"title":"","content":"Dangerous Business, just having your name lying around where anyone can pick it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T18:29:26-07:00","id":612875,"title":"","content":"Something from Dave, relayed from RPGnet:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DaveB</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">So GenCon is over now, and I'm in my room somewhere near Indy airport ready for the long trip home tomorrow. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Deviant, then.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Deviant is about people turned into supernatural beings by human actors - their transformation is &quot;messy&quot; compared to other beings, and they don't end up with an entirely stable &quot;template&quot;. Most are the result of human conspiracies, cults, mad science, and other groups. Even those whose change was self-inflicted are sought as assets. PC Deviants are the ones who've escaped the clutches of their conspiracy - for now - and have a thirst for revenge.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Deviant is Sense8, Orphan Black, Fringe, The Fly, Hulk, Guyver, Tetsuo The Iron Man, Akira, Hollow Man, Jekyll, Videodrome, Existenz, Scanners, Dark Angel, several versions of Beauty and the Beast, John Doe, Kyle XY... One thing I quickly realized after Rose and Rich handed me the blurb you've seen in the catalog and asked me to make a game out of it is how much inspirational media there is for it, which we've not tapped so far.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Also yes, many (but, crucially, not all) powers will be physically obvious, and yes, because the bulk of their foes are normal (albeit organized) people, they will trend to being the street level. The potential for Akira or Dr Manhatten-style blowouts will be there, but most Deviants will be the lowest-powered full game protagonists bar Hunters.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T19:48:47-07:00","id":612916,"title":"","content":"Would Alex Mercer or someone like him be in that &quot;Blow out&quot; category?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T19:52:40-07:00","id":612919,"title":"","content":"You know I was wondering if something along the lines of River Tam would work as a character concept- intellectually/psychically enhanced through brain surgery.<br /> <br /> I guess by listing Kyle XY, Scanners, and John Doe as inspirations, that the answer is yes.<br /> <br /> So I was trying to think of reasons why someone would make a deviant. Here's the list I came up with-<br /> <br /> Supersoldier.<br /> <br /> Longevity/immortality experiment/curing a disease or healing an injury<br /> <br /> Psychic research<br /> <br /> transhumanism<br /> <br /> Religious reasons like making the perfect vessel for their deity, or a do it yourself messiah<br /> <br /> Which just happens to be five things, not that I'm narcissistic enough to think I've just figured out what the five splats will be. lol<br /> <br /> So can anyone come up with other reasons some organization might make a deviant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T19:55:29-07:00","id":612923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612919#post612919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You know I was wondering if something along the lines of River Tam would work as a character concept- intellectually/psychically enhanced through brain surgery.<br /> <br /> I guess by listing Kyle XY, Scanners, and John Doe as inspirations, that the answer is yes.<br /> <br /> So I was trying to think of reasons why someone would make a deviant. Here's the list I came up with-<br /> <br /> Supersoldier.<br /> <br /> Longevity/immortality experiment/curing a disease or healing an injury<br /> <br /> Psychic research<br /> <br /> transhumanism<br /> <br /> Religious reasons like making the perfect vessel for their deity, or a do it yourself messiah<br /> <br /> Which just happens to be five things, not that I'm narcissistic enough to think I've just figured out what the five splats will be. lol<br /> <br /> So can anyone come up with other reasons some organization might make a deviant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because they can?<br /> <br /> Because an experiment went wrong?<br /> <br /> Because they successfully msfe one of the above but fucked up when they tried to replicate the results.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm an aspergic individual. This means that I can't imagine how others will react to situations. This has led to me accidentally offending someone, and has also led to me being less clear in statements than I thought I was. I'd like to apologize, and ask that others don't get mad, but just ask me to reword or clarify. Thank you","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3405-rater202","name":"Rater202","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T20:02:25-07:00","id":612929,"title":"","content":"Empires need slaves?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T20:03:04-07:00","id":612931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rater202</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612916#post612916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would Alex Mercer or someone like him be in that &quot;Blow out&quot; category?</div> </div> </div> </div> Even if the game didn't includes rules for that already, the mage chroniclers guide has the rules to make any nwod game go up to continent wrecking. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T21:05:09-07:00","id":612998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rater202</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612916#post612916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would Alex Mercer or someone like him be in that &quot;Blow out&quot; category?</div> </div> </div> </div>Definitely.<br /> <br /> He was meant to solo the game so that would be outside the norm, but you could have a group together equal to one Alex Mercer to bring it down closer to the norm. If there was only one player then it would make sense to boost them up to Alex Mercer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1526,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","user":"Diggs","date":". 08-03-2015, 12:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T22:28:18-07:00","id":613037,"title":"","content":"Love the idea behind this game, and not just because it adds more fringe science to the nWoD (but also because of that too.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T23:34:48-07:00","id":613051,"title":"","content":"So we know the inspirations for the game include &quot;<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><i><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Sense8, Orphan Black, Fringe, The Fly, Hulk, Guyver, Tetsuo The Iron Man, Akira, Hollow Man, Jekyll, Videodrome, Existenz, Scanners, Dark Angel, several versions of Beauty and the Beast, John Doe, and Kyle XY&quot; among others.<br /> <br /> So using those as benchmarks as to what will be possible in the game, what are you folks looking forward to playing in Deviant? </span></i></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},