croll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eugene Victor Tooms</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmm, okay, I always pictured him more as a slasher, but sure.<br /> <br /> Now I'm picturing people mistaking deviants for some of the more colorful slashers, and vice versa, in character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T00:41:14-07:00","id":613077,"title":"","content":"I want to go more occult than fringe science, unless the Conspiracies go full Delta Green alphabet soup and let me be an government-sanctioned alien abductee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T00:54:30-07:00","id":613082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=612919#post612919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So can anyone come up with other reasons some organization might make a deviant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well... I can tell you the motivation of the Cherion Group at my own table for all their experimentation - <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> those who are loyal to the Sign are seeking the enlightenment of communicating with their god. For millennia that's involved experimenting on the self to achieve an alien-enough state of being to comprehend and interact with the extradimensional entity. The current &quot;Board&quot; (the Cult's inner circle) believe that they require species-scale evolution of the human race, because their god is too massive to be interacted with as individuals. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T03:24:01-07:00","id":613167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=613075#post613075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Hmm, okay, I always pictured him more as a slasher, but sure.<br /> <br /> Now I'm picturing people mistaking deviants for some of the more colorful slashers, and vice versa, in character.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, it's not his motivation or origin, it's his skill set. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3771-damoqles","name":"damoqles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T05:39:27-07:00","id":613249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=613077#post613077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to go more occult than fringe science, unless the Conspiracies go full Delta Green alphabet soup and let me be an government-sanctioned alien abductee.</div> </div> </div> </div> Since we're talking the nWoD here, what's the difference? &quot;Fringe science&quot; has made its appearance as alchemy and the God-Machine's occult matrices. Even Task Force: Valkyrie's advanced armory gear is half-occult.<br /> <br /> As far as I'm aware, there are only four existing mega-corporations in the WoD to date (anyone know of others?). The first is arguably the ministries of the Chancellor, one of the Exarchs in Mage. Technically, there's at least two separate ministries (Mammon, Pantechnicon, maybe more), and they've got a focus on controlling the world through commercialism, but still viable. The second is The Cherion Group, which we're all familiar with. The third is Deva Corporation, the corporation with a focus on studying demons and the God Machine for its own profits and advancement. The last is the Hototogisu, which seems to be a crossover point in the Tokyo setting.<br /> <br /> In the case of Mammon and Deva Corp, there is zero difference between their science and occult practices. In TCG, they're using science to figure out how to take supernatural creatures for their own benefit, and they seem to be run by occult figures. The Hototogisu, like TCG, is studying the supernatural to steal their benefits, and is known for its uses of charms and attempts at fetish-crafting. <br /> <br /> I have yet to see a difference between magic and fringe science/technology in the WoD. The preview said, &quot;<i>Someone changed you; on a slab, an operating table, an altar.</i>&quot; It is not saying &quot;on a slab, an operating table, OR an alter.&quot; Chances are, its all three at once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 08-03-2015, 09:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T06:40:44-07:00","id":613303,"title":"","content":"Wait a minute. What if Deviant: The X is most or all of what has been suggested/speculated, and more?<br /> <br /> Sense8, Orphan Black, Fringe, The Fly, Hulk, Guyver, Tetsuo The Iron Man, Akira, Hollow Man, Videodrome, Existenz, Scanners, Dark Angel, several versions of Beauty and the Beast, John Doe, Kyle XY, H.G. Wells' The Invisible Man, Dr. Jekyll &amp; Mr. Hide, Alex Mercer, Robocop (he didn't choose to come back, remember?), <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Nameless_One\" target=\"_blank\">The Nameless One</a></b> (he awakens with immortality and amnesia in a more &quot;altar&quot; fashion), Invasion Of The Body Snatchers, The Island Of Dr. Moreau, Neuromancer, Aperture Science,<b> <a href=\"http://marvel.wikia.com/Marvel_Nemesis:_The_Imperfects_Vol_1\" target=\"_blank\">Marvel Nemesis: Imperfects</a></b> (this is one is a personal favorite for possible inspirational material) etc. Maybe the standard feel of the game will be various horrors reminiscent of some of the 1950's sci-fi B list movies, or the Cold War's Red/Yellow/Those Subhumans Scare? This may or may not turn out to be the official game-line that is closest to Genius. How &quot;close&quot; is up for debate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 08-03-2015, 10:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T06:52:20-07:00","id":613314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=613051#post613051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So using those as benchmarks as to what will be possible in the game, what are you folks looking forward to playing in Deviant?</div> </div> </div> </div>Helena Hyde.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T07:56:35-07:00","id":613364,"title":"","content":"Monica Valentinelli is the developer for Hunt