ath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T18:08:19-08:00","id":799990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=799705#post799705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just out of curiosity, what kind of evil corporations and organizations from fiction would be perfect for this game? We obviously have the Umbrella corporation, but what other suggestions do you have?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bFrom Marvel comics:<br /> Project Rebirth/Department H/Weapon Plus; Joint ventures between the U.S. and Canadian governments, intended to create living weapon\u200bs.<br /> The Red Room; Russia's version of Project Rebirth/Department H/Weapon Plus.<br /> Oscorp; Privately owned company, sometimes a defense contractor, prone to illegal/unethical medical experiments.<br /> Roxxon; Energy company, somewhere between our worlds Exxon/BP and CWoD's Pentex in terms of environmental safety.<br /> U-Men; Basically The Cheiron Group, they steal body parts from mutants in order to implant them into their own bodies to gain the mutant's powers.<br /> \u200bA.I.M.; Advanced Idea Mechanics, a group of mad-scientist types. banded together in order to conduct research with near-unlimited resources, and without any form of ethical oversight. Also, formerly the science division for 