-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WVKO3lHlvOs/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T18:37:53-07:00","id":917701,"title":"","content":"Every Deviant arises from a break event (experiment, ritual)? Or it may be a hunter who accumulated other supernatural elements and can not be considered human?<br /> <br /> So Alchemists (Promethean antagonists)? Skinchangers and Immortals would be absorbed into Desviant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T19:52:46-07:00","id":917741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917701#post917701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every Deviant arises from a break event (experiment, ritual)? Or it may be a hunter who accumulated other supernatural elements and can not be considered human?</div> </div> </div> </div> I think it's closer to the former than the latter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917701#post917701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So Alchemists (Promethean antagonists)? Skinchangers and Immortals would be absorbed into Desviant?</div> </div> </div> </div> I would certainly hope not; while you could build on those with the game, hopefully, there should always be room for things outside the accepted theories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T20:00:04-07:00","id":917744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917741#post917741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I think it's closer to the former than the latter.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>I am hoping that there are two types. Even that is included in the X-axis or Y-axis of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","user":"Ben Linus","date":". 06-20-2016, 04:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T04:22:01-07:00","id":917941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917413#post917413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about that Blowout Mode, though? My impression is that it will give automatic Successes on power activation rolls, similarly to Embracing The Wyrd. Instead of attracting Huntsmen, it pings the radars of Deviant-hunting groups, and inflicts Personal/Environmental Tilts left and right to represent a <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SuperPowerMeltdown\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Super Power Meltdown</b></a>.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Sorry, I should have said Scouring The Mask instead of Embracing The Wyrd.</div> </div> </div> </div>The default assumption is that deviant hunting groups are normal humans, so they don't have radars to ping beyond what normal people have.<br /> <br /> Since the term used was &quot;blowout,&quot; as in tire or oil well, that makes me think of something like Harry Dresden's habit of accidentally setting buildings on fire.<br /> <br /> So I'm expecting blowouts to be what happens when a deviant is willing to cause a local disaster to get out of a jam- blackouts, buildings burning down, freak weather, unexplained earthquakes, areas suddenly becoming radioactive, outbreaks of mysterious diseases, mass hallucinations, that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T10:09:18-07:00","id":918097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917701#post917701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every Deviant arises from a break event (experiment, ritual)? Or it may be a hunter who accumulated other supernatural elements and can not be considered human?<br /> <br /> So Alchemists (Promethean antagonists)? Skinchangers and Immortals would be absorbed into Desviant?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking that you could base a Deviant on those, but it would be a sort of &quot;minor template to major template&quot; thing. Even with Deviant's lower power level, it's still a major template, and more powerful than Immortals/Skinchangers/mortal psychics and so on. However, I'm certain you could have a character who started as one of those but whose powers grew out of control- we actually discussed it earlier in the thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T11:09:04-07:00","id":918137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=915467#post915467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're looking (and Deviant is still pre-writing, we're talking experiments with dice pools that don't even have names) at Deviant having more than one of some traits that have been singular so far, combining some things that are normally separate, and lacking others entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div>So... there might be more than one fuel type, or power stat, or integritype? Or the functions of a power stat broken into different traits, some of which may or may not combine with fuel or integritype (and which individual Deviants may not have all of)? Or power and integritype, or power and fuel, might be the same thing in some cases (I'd say fuel and integritype too, but that has been done)? If Jekyll and Hyde is one of the inspirations, different Willpowers for different personas, if there are such (as well as Virtues and Vices)? Or extra Willpower pools only usable on certain things? All sounds very interesting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=917941#post917941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The default assumption is that deviant hunting groups are normal humans, so they don't have radars to ping beyond what normal people have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some may have the knowledge to figure which weird news stories say &quot;Deviant,&quot; or at least &quot;Deviant of a particular type.&quot; Other may not. (This is one reason why I wonder whether who is after you will be mechanically represented in character generation.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Since the term used was &quot;blowout,&quot; as in tire or oil well, that makes me think of something like Harry Dresden's habit of accidentally setting buildings on fire. </div> </div> </div>It also makes me wonder if it's the end for the Deviant in question, or may well be. As well as whether all variations of Deviant will be capable of it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T08:58:33-07:00","id":919120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=918097#post918097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking that you could base a Deviant on those, but it would be a sort of &quot;minor template to major template&quot; thing. Even with Deviant's lower power level, it's still a major template, and more powerful than Immortals/Skinchangers/mortal psychics and so on</div> </div> </div> </div> Did a writer actually confirm that deviants are a major template, or is that just an assumption on your part?<br /> <br /> Don't get me wrong, I expect them to be a major template, but I don't recall seeing that they definitely will be. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T09:30:50-07:00","id":919135,"title":"","content":"They are.<br /> <br /> Kind of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T12:04:19-07:00","id":919242,"title":"","content":"I'm willing to bet they're a major except lacking one distinct quality that makes them such, like an Integrity Analogue(Instead using normal integrity) or a Power Stat, judging by the Word of Dave, then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T12:20:55-07:00","id":919255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=919242#post919242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm willing to bet they're a major except lacking one distinct quality that makes them such, like an Integrity Analogue(Instead using normal integrity) or a Power Stat, judging by the Word of Dave, then.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I'm thinking that Deviants might be their own minor template; that is, that not all Deviants start with all parts of their template, or that they might be a minor template mechanically save for some specific instances (during Blowout, maybe?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T17:54:13-07:00","id":919412,"title":"","content":"I like that. Maybe they're not necessarily a 'minor template' but all the typical 'pieces' of a major template are 'optional.' So one Deviant in a group might have a Power Stat, but another might have two of them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T17:47:24-07:00","id":921251,"title":"","content":"I'm getting really confused regarding what deviants are from a mechanics point of view.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/