y":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T07:25:51-07:00","id":928104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=927931#post927931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm confident that if it ends up having a superhero feel, it will be more X-Men or Doom Patrol than Justice League or Avengers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dave explicitly mentioned Orphan Black as inspiration for Deviant, so I'm thinking that it's going to be somewhere between Orphan Black and X-Men.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T16:52:23-07:00","id":928507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=927921#post927921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not a fan, because that forces the average party to be super thematically disparate. If that guy has robot arms and I'm cursed by a nameless goddess of the moon and she is a born mutant, that's nothing if not a superhero game. I'd really hope Deviant avoids the superhero feel, because that's not what I come to CofD for.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Considering one of the OP writers said that Deviant is the game for you if you want to be Robocop, Buffy the vampire slayer, and Sarah Manning taking on Umbrella Corp, I think you're going to be disappointed then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T16:22:55-07:00","id":928942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=927921#post927921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not a fan, because that forces the average party to be super thematically disparate. If that guy has robot arms and I'm cursed by a nameless goddess of the moon and she is a born mutant, that's nothing if not a superhero game. I'd really hope Deviant avoids the superhero feel, because that's not what I come to CofD for.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, in Promethean you can have a party made up of Frankenstein Jr., a corpse animated by a nanobot colony, an undead shaman, The Astonishing Nuclear Man, and the Golem of Prague.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T16:37:30-07:00","id":928952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=928942#post928942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, in Promethean you can have a party made up of Frankenstein Jr., a corpse animated by a nanobot colony, an undead shaman, The Astonishing Nuclear Man, and the Golem of Prague.</div> </div> </div> </div>And in Mage, you can have a Houngan, Harry Dresden, a stage magician and an alchemist investigate zombies animated by vampiric smoke owls. The short version of what we're getting at, I think, is that any given group is only as disparate as they choose to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T03:11:44-07:00","id":929142,"title":"","content":"I dunno, I kinda feel like Deviant is an opportunity to play around with body horror and fear of recapture: secret world of Alex Mack type stuff. Though it sounds like you guys are going for a bit higher power level than I'm thinking of... Maybe like Static Shock...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Rekindled: The Oroboroi Chronicles.</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">The official reboot of <b>Dragon: The Embers</b>.</span></span></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","name":"RockstarRaccoon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10120_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T09:21:27-07:00","id":929248,"title":"","content":"I think it's going to have a variable power scale. Didn't it pretty much have the full spectrum of inspiration from Orphan Black to Akira? Now I don't imagine it'll full go to city destroying except maybe in Burnout mode, but I think it could well go to x-men level at the high end of the scale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T17:56:51-07:00","id":929468,"title":"","content":"One of the OP folks stated that Deviants are going to be the weakest gameline protagonist barring hunters to date, but that since their opponents are regular humans, that's generally enough.<br /> <br /> If that isn't enough, then there's always blowout, but that name really suggests that you don't do that unless you're willing for bad bad things to happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T19:08:56-07:00","id":929490,"title":"","content":"- Minor templates may be converted into Deviant?<br /> <br /> - Deviant will own Minor Template?<br /> <br /> - Things like Clones or Fetchs could be turned into Desviants?<br /> <br /> - A Deviant may have triggered the event itself that generated it?<br /> <br /> - Only humans can create desviants or they may be created by other desviants?<br /> <br /> - Desviants may be created by supernatural beings accidentally and intentionally, as Vampires, Wizards, Werewolves, Mummies, Horrors?<br /> <br /> - Desviants only arise from a break event or may arise from the contamination of this event later times as a radioactive contamination bred a desviant years later?<br /> <br /> - Desviants can arise instead of a big break event a large accumulation of small events, like a hunter who has acquired so many powers, which no longer can tell exactly what he's human? What would make the game even absorb the cyber-punk themed but for anything (not just technology), including magic and other variables.<br /> <br /> - Experiment / Ritual to create a Desviant can not hit the target but the child him or her as a kind of hereditary curse? Or reach them, both the person and the child that will have?<br /> <br /> - Experiment / Ritual can be an accident. And it can be generated by himself?<br /> <br /> - Desviants may accumulate mixed characteristics (more than one form of energy)? May undergo ritual experiment after already being a Desviant?<br /> <br /> - Morality will have some connection to not be consumed by power derived from ritual / experiment?<br /> <br /> - They will have full free will or may be something like Robocop or Hyde when using the Formula and this is a problem to solve?<br /> <br /> - The theme will be revenge or transhumanism?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T19:42:42-07:00","id":929510,"title":"","content":"I do hope they have some stuff on potentially hacking the setting even further, since it looks so flexible already. Also, a Deviant dark era has been mentioned and I hope the forum does some work on that when it comes out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T19:49:37-07:00","id":929513,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Linus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=929490#post929490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- Minor templates may be converted into Deviant?<br /> <br /> - Deviant will own Minor Template?<br /> <br /> - Things like Clones or Fetchs could be turned into Desviants?<br /> <br /> - A Deviant may have triggered the event itself that generated it?<br /> <br /> - Only humans can create desviants or they may be created by other desviants?<br /> <br /> - Desviants may be created by supernatural beings accidentally and intentionally, as Vampires, Wizards, Werewolves, Mummies, Horrors?<br /> <br /> - Desviants only arise from a break event or may arise from the contamination of this event later times as a radioactive contamination bred a desviant years later?<br /> <br /> - Desviants can arise instead of a big break event a large accumulation of small events, like a hunter who has acquired so many powers, which no longer can tell exactly what he's human? What would make the game even absorb the cyber-punk themed but for anything (not just technology), including magic and other variables.<br /> <br /> - Experiment / Ritual to create a Desviant can not hit the target but the child him or her as a kind of hereditary curse? Or reach them, both the person and the child that will have?<br /> <br /> - Experiment / Ritual can be an accident. And it can be generated by himself?<br /> <br /> - Desviants may accumulate mixed characteristics (more than one form of energy)? May undergo ritual experiment after already being a Desviant?<br /> <br /> - Morality will have some connection to not be consumed by power derived from ritual / experiment?<br /> <br /> - They will have full free will or may be something like Robocop or Hyde when using the Formula and this is a problem to solve?<br /> <br /> - The theme will be revenge or transhumanism?</div> </div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div><br /> OK, so here's where my irritation with a fellow poster <b><i><u>may</u></i></b> cause me to act like a jerk, but please bear with me:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><u><i><b>WE DON'T KNOW, SO PLEASE STOP ASKING THE SAME POORLY WORDED, BADLY MISPELLED QUESTIONS EVERY DAY!!! YOUR QUESTIONS WILL BE ANSWERED WHEN THE INFORMATION BECOMES AVAILABLE!! </b></i></u></span></span></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> 4,8,15,16,23,42.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":6138,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","user":"Mangle77","date":". 07-10-2016, 10:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T19:55:58-07:00","id":929516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=929510#post929510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do hope they have some stuff on potentially hacking the setting even further, since it looks so flexible already. Also, a Deviant dark era has been mentioned and I hope the forum does some work on that when it comes out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Victorian Devant might be fun, with people changed by steam engines and vaccum tubes fighting alongside escapees from exotic cults in the Orient. It would feel very, very pulp, but that's not always so bad.<br /> <br /> It could also be neat to see Deviants born from Olympian curses in Ancient Greece; so many poor mythological characters anger or get in the way of the gods and are horribly transformed by it. Arachne makes a good template for a Deviant who had it coming to them, while Medusa is a victim of circumstance and cruelty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T21:44:18-07:00","id":929547,"title":"","content":"Ancient Greece would be a great curveball one, one that people wouldn't initially associate with Deviant but one that fits because of the &quot;divine curse&quot; idea you mentioned. I'm pretty much certain that &quot;cursed&quot; is going to be explicitly mentioned as a possible origin.<br /> <br /> Somewhere between the 50s and 70s would also be fun, to coincide with the Silver Age of Comics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T00:42:31-07:00","id":929606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=929547#post929547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ancient Greece would be a great curveball one, one that people wouldn't initially associate with Deviant but one that fits because of the &amp;quot;divine curse&amp;quot; idea you mentioned. I'm pretty much certain that &amp;quot;cursed&amp;quot; is going to be explicitly mentioned as a possible origin.<br /> <br /> Somewhere between the 50s and 70s would also be fun, to coincide with the Silver Age of Comics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hell, I just realized that Kratos (from God of War) would make an excellent high-power Deviant; he's been extraordinarily fucked by powers beyond how control, and is willing to burn the world down around him to get even.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T01:00:53-07:00","id":929610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=929547#post929547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Somewhere between the 50s and 70s would also be fun, to coincide with the Silver Age of Comics.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fifties strike me as most appropriate, as it's also the time of extremely pulpy sci-fi/horror movies, a lot of them about contemporary monsters created by science experiments gone wrong: the Fly, Indestructible Man, Robot Monster, Invisible Monster, The Magnetic Monster... with Deviant-esque monsters hunted in cinemas all across the States, it's probably not a good time to be a Deviant. Which makes it a perfect setting for Deviant, if you catch my drift <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'd be interested in running a WW2 game with victims of Nazi and/or Soviet experiments banding together against their tormentors, but I don't think it's a good idea for OPP to release any official material for that - I'd rather figure it out myself with my friends who I know won't be offended than watch the inevitable shitstorm sweep over the fandom...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T08:46:14-07:00","id":930875,"title":"","content":"I wonder what the Integrity equivalent will be like, and if it will be customizable. Maybe it will be tied into themes of self-control and desire for revenge? They<i> are</i> called Deviants, so maybe there will be a social aspect to this trait.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T09:00:20-07:00","id":930885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=930875#post930875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what the Integrity equivalent will be like, and if it will be customizable. Maybe it will be tied into themes of self-control and desire for revenge? They<i> are</i> called Deviants, so maybe there will be a social aspect to this trait.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a feeling that it's going to boil down to, &quot;Don't go full Tetsuo Shima.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T09:37:22-07:00","id":930909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=930885#post930885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have a feeling that it's going to boil down to, &quot;Don't go full Tetsuo Shima.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> &quot;\u200bYou went Full Tetsuo! NEVER go Full Tetsuo!&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T09:50:28-07:00","id":930913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=930909#post930909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;\u200bYou went Full Tetsuo! NEVER go Full Tetsuo!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;On a scale from Testuo Shima to Buffy Summers, how egomaniacal are you feeling today?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T09:24:09-07:00","id":932932,"title":"","content":"I love coming up with ideas for inter-splat conflicts, and it was fun coming up with ideas for how various splats might create Deviants. I also kind of feel like some Deviants might feel a special kinship with Vampires, Changelings, Sin-Eaters, and Mummies- they might even think of those beings as other Deviants, just more powerful ones whose means of creation turned out to be repeatable and relatively stable. And you could easily have a Deviant who came from an attempt to create an &quot;artificial&quot; replica of a splat. The thread touched on the idea of an attempt to duplicate the Rite of Return, but you could do it with any splat. A secret Autumn Court project to create their own Changelings, an Idigam that wonders if it's possible to turn humans into werewolves, a guilt-wracked Demiurge who tries to turn himself into a Promethean so he and his creation can be together, a necromancer who experiments with binding ghosts to people in increasing number and power...<br /> <br /> A lot of potential for plot and tragedy with a &quot;counterfeit&quot; supernatural being interacting with the genuine article.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T10:32:11-07:00","id":932954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=932932#post932932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love coming up with ideas for inter-splat conflicts, and it was fun coming up with ideas for how various splats might create Deviants. I also kind of feel like some Deviants might feel a special kinship with Vampires, Changelings, Sin-Eaters, and Mummies- they might even think of those beings as other Deviants, just more powerful ones whose means of creation turned out to be repeatable and relatively stable. And you could easily have a Deviant who came from an attempt to create an &quot;artificial&quot; replica of a splat. The thread touched on the idea of an attempt to duplicate the Rite of Return, but you could do it with any splat. A secret Autumn Court project to create their own Changelings, an Idigam that wonders if it's possible to turn humans into werewolves, a guilt-wracked Demiurge who tries to turn himself into a Promethean so he and his creation can be together, a necromancer who experiments with binding ghosts to people in increasing number and power...<br /> <br /> A lot of potential for plot and tragedy with a &quot;counterfeit&quot; supernatural being interacting with the genuine article.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm expecting something more along the lines of each game line's dedicated minor splat than the major splats. Changeling 1e was interesting because you could very easily create True Fae who were, for all intents and purposes, copies of major splat characters. It was very easy to create a True Fae who was, for all intents and purposes, a Daeva Vampire, or an Elodoth Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Assuming that it's the way the writers are taking Deviant, I'm expecting to see characters who can easily model Ghouls, or Wolf-blooded, or Stigmatics. Somebody who can push their physical abilities beyond human limits, but needs to have a high iron intake to compensate... somebody who was bonded with a wolf-spirit to try and create a werewolf... somebody given all sorts of biotech by a transhumanist cult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 07-17-2016, 03:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T18:58:35-07:00","id":936356,"title":"","content":"Given how flexible the rules have been hinted at being and how different Deviants can be, I hope there's lot of room to make up and customize lots of nasty risks and drawbacks for characters, even if they don't Blowout.<br /> <br /> Also, I suspect that the rules will be of great use to homebrewers, since it sounds like, among other things, you could easily use them to build Fomori.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T00:58:57-07:00","id":936450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=936356#post936356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how flexible the rules have been hinted at being and how different Deviants can be, I hope there's lot of room to make up and customize lots of nasty risks and drawbacks for characters, even if they don't Blowout.<br /> <br /> Also, I suspect that the rules will be of great use to homebrewers, <u>since it sounds like, among other things, you could easily use them to build Fomori.</u></div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly the appeal for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T20:44:47-07:00","id":943350,"title":"","content":"Weren't they going to give us some new information today?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T20:48:39-07:00","id":943355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>K9ine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=943350#post943350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weren't they going to give us some new information today?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe, but if it's from a GenCon panel, the information may be announced not in the Internet (yet).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span