y Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T10:19:05-07:00","id":945526,"title":"","content":"That was the story behind Batman &amp; Robin Eternal.<br /> <br /> This has potential to be a very comic book-like game.<br /> <br /> The Monster Men are coming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-07-2016, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T10:28:24-07:00","id":945534,"title":"","content":"I like how the CofD games have really been trying to make each game line unique in feel and mechanics. Mummy's falling power stat was really interesting, Demon's abandoning of a true morality stat was awesome, and while I have problems with its crunch and fluff, Beast did make a valiant effort to be something new and interesting, and will probably improve as more books are published. I have high hopes for Deviant. I'm very excited to see how it handles its x-splats and y-splats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"co