ll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If this will let me play Alex Mercer then I'm sold.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's going to be the weakest template after Hunter, so you could probably play someone &quot;like&quot; Alex Mercer... just a lot lot lot less powerful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T07:16:44-07:00","id":947746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=947307#post947307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How about a Crossover Chronicle made up of a Changeling Loyalist, a Deviant loyalist, a Pure, a Seer of the Throne, A<br /> Belial's Brood Vampire in service to the Strix, a Centmanni Promeathan as a party? Sounds like an adventure ;D</div> </div> </div> </div>So, the Evil League of Evil?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=947729#post947729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, it's going to be the weakest template after Hunter, so you could probably play someone &quot;like&quot; Alex Mercer... just a lot lot lot less powerful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's always Blowout. They might not last long <i>after</i> being Alex Mercer, but they still might be able to.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-10-2016, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T08:22:09-07:00","id":947792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Innes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=947629#post947629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Myrmidons like the <i>ants</i>. Which the Seer Proximi are named after.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was using it to refer to the tribe of warriors who fought under Achilles in the Trojan War. <br /> <br /> It was also used in Manichaeism to refer to a caste of soldier demons, and in pre-Industrial Europe, it carried the same connotations that &quot;minion&quot; does today. Nowadays, it carries the connotation of a follower who carries out their orders without question or protest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T11:48:20-07:00","id":947917,"title":"","content":"I bet Deviants could get a lot of use out of the various Supernatural Style Merits. Hopefully this'll motivate me to work on some of the ones I've been thinking over. Power Armor Operation, High Speed Combat, and Aerial Maneuvering in particular would be good matches, and something like a &quot;Body Weaponry&quot; style would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T13:23:15-07:00","id":947997,"title":"","content":"These news showed me many things.<br /> <br /> But still I wonder if smaller models can have their extended powers and become renegades?<br /> <br /> If a renegade can be born an accumulation of &quot;small scars&quot;?<br /> <br /> It can be created by a supernatural being (or antagonist playable)?<br /> <br /> Or replicate a supernatural being (failed attempts to replicate the return rite of Mummies or alchemists who try to absorb as much pyros or parts of prometeanos they see a mix between a Promethean and a human, for example)?<br /> <br /> Or through synthetic thing as fetchs being transformed them (also by ritual or experiment)?<br /> <br /> And also the transformation can be slow? Or as a Lovecraft tale derived from a hybrid with some creature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T05:39:34-07:00","id":948535,"title":"","content":"So thinking about possible dark eras for this line the first I thought of was the sixties- Turn on, Tune In, Drop out of of the human race.<br /> <br /> Another idea was to take advantage of the conspiratorial nature of Deviant and use that as a basis.<br /> <br /> Like american revolutionary war- Thanks to the freemasons, Washington's spies have some odd members.<br /> <br /> Or the crusades, play deviants created by the Templars or the Hashashins. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T09:06:38-07:00","id":948639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=948535#post948535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> So thinking about possible dark eras for this line the first I thought of was the sixties- Turn on, Tune In, Drop out of of the human race.<br /> <br /> Another idea was to take advantage of the conspiratorial nature of Deviant and use that as a basis.<br /> <br /> Like american revolutionary war- Thanks to the freemasons, Washington's spies have some odd members.<br /> <br /> Or the crusades, play deviants created by the Templars or the Hashashins.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>MKULTRA seems like a perfect hook for a Deviant Org.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T18:28:20-07:00","id":948981,"title":"","content":"If there isn't a &quot;Symbiont&quot;/&quot;Merged&quot; Clade, I'm going to have to homebrew one. Though I'd be surprised if there wasn't one- it's both present in source material and an incredible source of horror. &quot;They put something inside of you, and it changed you- it's a part of you now. And it talks to you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T18:31:41-07:00","id":948984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=948981#post948981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there isn't a &quot;Symbiont&quot;/&quot;Merged&quot; Clade, I'm going to have to homebrew one. Though I'd be surprised if there wasn't one- it's both present in source material and an incredible source of horror. &quot;They put something inside of you, and it changed you- it's a part of you now. And it talks to you.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>and it gives you a horrible craving for... fluffernutter......","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T00:34:22-07:00","id":949171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=948981#post948981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there isn't a &amp;quot;Symbiont&amp;quot;/&amp;quot;Merged&amp;quot; Clade, I'm going to have to homebrew one. Though I'd be surprised if there wasn't one- it's both present in source material and an incredible source of horror. &amp;quot;They put something inside of you, and it changed you- it's a part of you now. And it talks to you.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you mean Origin? Although honestly, it could be both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T10:58:12-07:00","id":949415,"title":"","content":"Whatever the name for a group of Deviants is, it's always going to make me think of the scene in The Venture Brothers where the members of the Revenge Society bond over all having been mutated by scientific accidents. Know I want to play a mixed Deviant/Mage/Alchemist/Promethean campaign where the players play supervillains. <br /> <br /> And from what we've heard, Symbiont would be more like a Clade than an Origin. Origins are things like volunteer, self-made, etc.<br /> <br /> Another interesting scenario would be for a PC to be loyal to a conspiracy...that doesn't exist any more. For whatever reason, the conspiracy that created and/or employed them is either destroyed or taken over, and the Deviant is out in the cold, and likely being hunted either by enemies of the conspiracy looking for loose ends, or by the &quot;new management&quot;.<br /> <br /> And I do hope Blowouts aren't necessarily lethal. I mean, I'm fine with them being extremely dangerous, but I'd rather it was possible to possibly survive one- or that there are different levels of Blowout, and it's possibly to use an extremely powerful and dangerous level that's not as powerful or lethal as the highest one. I'd be fine even having this as an optional rule, but I really would like it be in there. An example would be, to reference one of Dave's inspirations, what happens when Eleven pushes her powers and collapses. I'd also assume that there's a lasting effect, too. I'm not saying characters should be able to throw around Blowouts. Doing one should be an integrity-stat hit, and probably some other lasting downsides.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 08-12-2016, 11:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T02:30:06-07:00","id":949947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/608073-deviant-the-subtitle-discussion?p=949415#post949415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I do hope Blowouts aren't necessarily lethal. I mean, I'm fine with them being extremely dangerous, but I'd rather it was possible to possibly survive one- or that there are different levels of Blowout, and it's possibly to use an extremely powerful and dangerous level that's not as powerful or lethal as the highest one. I'd be fine even having this as an optional rule, but I really would like it be in there. An example would be, to reference one of Dave's inspirations, what happens when Eleven pushes her powers and collapses. I'd also assume that there's a lasting effect, too. I'm not saying characters should be able to throw around Blowouts. Doing one should be an integrity-stat hit, and probably some other lasting downsides.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it would be best if the Blowout is linked to your current level, giving you a powerful version of the level above. So if you use a Blowout on a second level power you get a souped up version of the third level. How bad it is for you depends on the level of power used, from migraines and being knocked out to injury, mutation and death for the highest level.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T08:20:50-07:00","id":950044,"title":"","content":"I have feeling that it will depend upon how long the blowout goes on for as to how lethal it gets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}